"900BU",14.88, 0.50,"R",79.00,"Applicable in NY: Applicable to all claim forms for insurance and all applications for commercial insurance and accident and health"
"900BU",15.78, 0.50,"R", 6.33,"insurance:"
"900MU",15.78, 6.83,"R",72.67," Any person who knowingly and with intent to defraud any insurance company or other person files an application for insurance or"
"900MU",16.65, 0.50,"R",79.00,"statement of claim containing any materially false information, or conceals for the purpose of misleading, information concerning any fact"
"900MU",17.50, 0.50,"R",79.00,"material thereto, commits a fraudulent insurance act, which is a crime, and shall also be subject to a civil penalty not to exceed five thousand"
"900MU",18.35, 0.50,"L", 0.00,"dollars and the stated value of the claim for each such violation."
"900BU",20.08, 0.50,"R",54.48,"Applicable in NY: Applicable to all applications and claim forms for automobile insurance:"
"900MU",20.08,54.98,"R",24.52,"  Any person who knowingly and with intent"
"900MU",20.95, 0.50,"R",79.00,"to defraud any insurance company or other person files an application for commercial insurance or a statement of claim for any commercial or"
"900MU",21.80, 0.50,"R",79.00,"personal insurance benefits containing any materially false information, or conceals for the purpose of misleading, information concerning any"
"900MU",22.65, 0.50,"R",79.00,"fact material thereto, and any person who, in connection with such application or claim, knowingly makes or knowingly assists, abets, solicits"
"900MU",23.50, 0.50,"R",79.00,"or conspires with another to make a false report of the theft, destruction, damage or conversion of any motor vehicle to a law enforcement"
"900MU",24.35, 0.50,"R",79.00,"agency, the department of motor vehicles or an insurance company commits a fraudulent insurance act, which is a crime, and shall also be"
"900MU",25.20, 0.50,"L", 0.00,"subject to a civil penalty not to exceed five thousand dollars and the value of the subject motor vehicle or stated claim for each violation."
"900BU", 4.76, 0.50,"R",10.56,"Applicable in NJ:"
"900MU", 4.76,12.17,"R",67.33,"Any person who includes any false or misleading information on an application for an insurance policy is subject to"
"900MU", 5.63, 0.50,"L", 0.00,"criminal and civil penalties."
"900BU", 6.88, 0.50,"R",10.48,"Applicable in OR:"
"900MU", 6.88,11.75,"R",67.75,"Any person who knowingly and with intent to defraud or solicit another to defraud the insurer by submitting an application"
"900MU", 7.75, 0.50,"L", 0.00,"containing a false statement as to any material fact may be violating state law."
"900BU", 9.31, 0.50,"R",10.41,"Applicable in PR:"
"900MU", 9.31,11.74,"R",67.76,"Any person who knowingly and with the intention of defrauding presents false information in an insurance application, or"
"900MU",10.18, 0.50,"R",79.00,"presents, helps, or causes the presentation of a fraudulent claim for the payment of a loss or any other benefit, or presents more than one"
"900MU",11.03, 0.50,"R",79.00,"claim for the same damage or loss, shall incur a felony and, upon conviction, shall be sanctioned for each violation by a fine of not less than"
"900MU",11.88, 0.50,"R",79.00,"five thousand dollars ($5,000) and not more than ten thousand dollars ($10,000), or a fixed term of imprisonment for three (3) years, or both"
"900MU",12.73, 0.50,"R",79.00,"penalties.  Should aggravating circumstances be present, the penalty thus established may be increased to a maximum of five (5) years, if"
"900MU",13.58, 0.50,"L", 0.00,"extenuating circumstances are present, it may be reduced to a minimum of two (2) years."
